<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>ragathin</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/background.png" />
  <style>
    @font-face {
      font-family: 'VipnaBold';
      src: url('/fonts/Vipnagorgialla-Bold.otf') format('opentype');
      font-weight: normal;
      font-style: normal;
    }

    @font-face {
      font-family: 'VipnaRg';
      src: url('/fonts/VipnagorgillaRg.otf') format('opentype');
      font-weight: normal;
      font-style: normal;
    }

    *, *::before, *::after {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    html, body {
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 100%;
      background: #ede8e1;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      font-weight: normal;
    }

    #bg-img {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      z-index: 0;
    }

    #glow {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 1;
      pointer-events: none;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse 90% 50% at 50% 54%, rgba(255,60,100,0.09) 0%, transparent 100%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 26% at 50% 54%, rgba(255,18,68,0.28) 0%, rgba(255,50,95,0.10) 60%, transparent 100%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse 38% 10% at 50% 54%, rgba(255,0,52,0.88) 0%, rgba(255,15,65,0.70) 28%, rgba(245,10,60,0.38) 60%, transparent 100%);
      filter: blur(28px);
    }

    #logo-block {
      position: fixed;
      top: 44px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      z-index: 5;
      pointer-events: none;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    #logo-pronunciation {
      font-family: 'VipnaRg', monospace;
      font-weight: normal;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: normal;
      color: #111;
      opacity: 0.45;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    #center-logo {
      max-width: 70vw;
      max-height: 30vh;
      object-fit: contain;
      display: block;
    }

    #logo-tagline {
      font-family: 'VipnaRg', monospace;
      font-weight: normal;
      font-size: 13px;
      letter-spacing: normal;
      color: #111;
      text-transform: none;
    }

    #logo-subtagline {
      font-family: 'VipnaRg', monospace;
      font-weight: normal;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: normal;
      color: #111;
      opacity: 0.5;
      font-style: italic;
    }

    /* ── THREE COLUMN LAYOUT ── */
    #columns {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 10;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: row;
    }

    .col {
      flex: 1;
      height: 100%;
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 28px 0 0 28px;
    }


    /* ── SMALL CARD ── */
    .seller-card {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 16px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .seller-img-wrap {
      width: 110px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 5px;
    }

    .worn-img {
      object-fit: cover;
      display: block;
      filter: url(#worn) contrast(1.6) brightness(0.88) saturate(0.15) sepia(0.3);
      animation: img-drift 9s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    @keyframes img-drift {
      0%   { filter: url(#worn) contrast(1.6)  brightness(0.88) saturate(0.15) sepia(0.3); }
      30%  { filter: url(#worn) contrast(1.75) brightness(0.82) saturate(0.08) sepia(0.45); }
      55%  { filter: url(#worn) contrast(1.55) brightness(0.92) saturate(0.2)  sepia(0.2); }
      100% { filter: url(#worn) contrast(1.6)  brightness(0.88) saturate(0.15) sepia(0.3); }
    }

    .seller-img-small {
      width: 110px;
      height: 145px;
    }

    /* ── BARCODE ── */
    .barcode-wrap {
      width: 110px;
      position: relative;
    }

    .barcode-svg {
      width: 100%;
      display: block;
      transform: skewX(-0.8deg) scaleY(0.96);
      transform-origin: bottom left;
      opacity: 0.82;
      animation: barcode-breathe 11s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    @keyframes barcode-breathe {
      0%,100% { opacity: 0.82; transform: skewX(-0.8deg)  scaleY(0.96); }
      40%     { opacity: 0.72; transform: skewX(-1.2deg)  scaleY(0.93); }
      70%     { opacity: 0.85; transform: skewX(-0.4deg)  scaleY(0.97); }
    }

    .barcode-wrap::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      left: -2px; right: -2px;
      height: 2px;
      top: 38%;
      background: rgba(20,10,5,0.55);
      transform: skewX(-1deg);
      mix-blend-mode: multiply;
    }

    /* ── TEXT ── */
    .seller-text {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 14px;
      padding-top: 2px;
    }

    .seller-line-name {
      font-family: 'VipnaBold', monospace;
      font-size: 52px;
      line-height: 0.88;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      color: #111;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      transform: rotate(-0.6deg);
      display: block;
      mix-blend-mode: multiply;
      opacity: 0.92;
    }

    .make-offer-btn {
      font-family: 'VipnaRg', monospace;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.28em;
      color: #111;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      cursor: pointer;
      background: none;
      border: none;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
      padding: 0 0 3px 0;
      text-align: left;
      opacity: 0.65;
      transition: opacity 0.2s, letter-spacing 0.2s;
      mix-blend-mode: multiply;
    }

    .make-offer-btn:hover {
      opacity: 1;
      letter-spacing: 0.34em;
    }

    /* ── LARGE IMAGE — bottom of each column ── */
    .seller-large-wrap {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      z-index: 1;
      -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 0%, black 18%);
      mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 0%, black 18%);
    }

    .seller-img-large {
      width: 100%;
      height: 72vh;
      object-fit: cover;
      object-position: center top;
      display: block;
    }

    /* ── OFFER OVERLAY ── */
    #offer-overlay {
      display: none;
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      background: #080808;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    #offer-overlay.active { display: flex; }

    #offer-overlay::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background-image: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.055) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 18px 18px;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
    }

    #offer-overlay::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(
        to bottom,
        transparent, transparent 27px,
        rgba(255,255,255,0.025) 27px,
        rgba(255,255,255,0.025) 28px
      );
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
    }

    .scan-line {
      position: absolute;
      left: 0; right: 0;
      height: 2px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, rgba(255,0,40,0.18) 20%, rgba(255,0,40,0.35) 50%, rgba(255,0,40,0.18) 80%, transparent 100%);
      animation: scan 14s linear infinite;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    @keyframes scan {
      0%   { top: -2px; }
      100% { top: 100%; }
    }

    .corner-marks {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 20px;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .corner-marks::before,
    .corner-marks::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      width: 22px;
      height: 22px;
      border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      border-style: solid;
    }

    .corner-marks::before { top: 0; left: 0; border-width: 1px 0 0 1px; }
    .corner-marks::after  { bottom: 0; right: 0; border-width: 0 1px 1px 0; }

    #offer-inner {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 520px;
      padding: 0 32px;
      gap: 0;
    }

    #offer-header {
      font-family: 'VipnaBold', monospace;
      font-size: 72px;
      line-height: 0.85;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: #fff;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      opacity: 0.06;
      transform: rotate(-1deg) translateX(-4px);
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      pointer-events: none;
      user-select: none;
    }

    #offer-seller-name {
      font-family: 'VipnaRg', monospace;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.3em;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .glyph-strip {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      width: 100%;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .glyph-strip-line {
      flex: 1;
      height: 1px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    }

    .glyph-strip-symbols {
      font-family: monospace;
      font-size: 9px;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.18);
      padding: 0 12px;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    #offer-label {
      font-family: 'VipnaRg', monospace;
      font-size: 9px;
      letter-spacing: 0.5em;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.18);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    #offer-input-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      width: 100%;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      padding-bottom: 10px;
    }

    #offer-prompt {
      font-family: monospace;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: rgba(255,0,40,0.55);
      margin-right: 10px;
    }

    #offer-input {
      flex: 1;
      background: transparent;
      border: none;
      outline: none;
      font-family: 'VipnaRg', monospace;
      font-size: 22px;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 0;
      caret-color: rgba(255,0,40,0.8);
      line-height: 1;
    }

    #offer-input::placeholder { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); }

    .glyph-strip.bottom { margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 28px; }

    #offer-close-hint {
      font-family: monospace;
      font-size: 8px;
      letter-spacing: 0.4em;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    #offer-close-hint:hover { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); }

    /* ── DIALOGUE ── */
    #dialogue {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 6;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 8px;
      width: 480px;
      max-width: 88vw;
      margin: 70vh auto 60px;
      padding: 0 16px;
      font-weight: normal;
    }

    #dialogue-intro {
      font-family: 'VipnaRg', monospace;
      font-weight: normal;
      font-size: 16px;
      letter-spacing: normal;
      color: #111;
      opacity: 0.5;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .dialogue-title {
      font-family: 'VipnaRg', monospace;
      font-weight: normal;
      font-size: 18px;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      color: #111;
      opacity: 1;
      text-transform: lowercase;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    #dialogue-2 {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 6;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 8px;
      width: 480px;
      max-width: 88vw;
      margin: 80px auto 60px;
      padding: 0 16px;
      font-weight: normal;
    }

    #dialogue-3 {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 6;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 8px;
      width: 480px;
      max-width: 88vw;
      margin: 80px auto 60px;
      padding: 0 16px;
      font-weight: normal;
    }

    #bottom-img {
      display: block;
      max-width: 160px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 6;
    }

    .dialogue-line {
      font-family: 'VipnaRg', monospace;
      font-weight: normal;
      font-size: 16px;
      letter-spacing: normal;
      color: #e8203a;
      line-height: 1.6;
      background: rgba(18, 12, 14, 0.88);
      padding: 2px 8px;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .dialogue-line .speaker {
      font-weight: normal;
      color: #ede8e1;
      margin-right: 8px;
      opacity: 0.9;
      text-transform: lowercase;
    }

    .dialogue-line .direction {
      font-style: italic;
      color: #c0183080;
      margin-right: 4px;
    }

    #copyright {
      font-family: 'VipnaRg', monospace;
      font-weight: normal;
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: normal;
      color: #111;
      opacity: 0.35;
      text-align: center;
      margin: 24px auto 48px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 6;
    }

    .dialogue-action {
      font-family: 'VipnaRg', monospace;
      font-weight: normal;
      font-size: 13px;
      letter-spacing: normal;
      color: #d4a0a8;
      line-height: 1.6;
      font-style: italic;
      margin: 4px 0;
      background: rgba(18, 12, 14, 0.6);
      padding: 2px 8px;
      display: inline-block;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="width:0;height:0;position:absolute;">
    <defs>
      <filter id="worn" x="-5%" y="-5%" width="110%" height="110%" color-interpolation-filters="sRGB">
        <feTurbulence type="fractalNoise" baseFrequency="0.72" numOctaves="4" seed="3" result="noise"/>
        <feColorMatrix type="saturate" values="0" in="noise" result="grey-noise"/>
        <feBlend in="SourceGraphic" in2="grey-noise" mode="multiply" result="grained"/>
        <feTurbulence type="turbulence" baseFrequency="0.012 0.008" numOctaves="2" seed="8" result="warp"/>
        <feDisplacementMap in="grained" in2="warp" scale="4" xChannelSelector="R" yChannelSelector="G" result="warped"/>
        <feComposite in="warped" in2="SourceGraphic" operator="in"/>
      </filter>
    </defs>
  </svg>

  <img id="bg-img" src="/images/background.png" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'" />
  <div id="logo-block">
    <span id="logo-pronunciation">/ræɡʌθɪn/ [noun, verb]</span>
    <img id="center-logo" src="/images/ragathinkithorizontalblank.png" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'" />
    <span id="logo-tagline">ragathinning kit</span>
    <span id="logo-subtagline">(tactical goods)</span>

  </div>

  <div id="columns">

    <!-- ONE -->
    <div class="col">
    </div>

    <!-- TWO -->
    <div class="col">
    </div>

    <!-- THREE -->
    <div class="col">
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- DIALOGUE -->
  <div id="dialogue">
    <div id="dialogue-intro">start</div>
    <div class="dialogue-title">preface</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">SLYV</span><span class="direction">(whispering to Neue)</span> What was that word? That your friend used?</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">NEUE</span><span class="direction">(intrigued)</span> Which word?</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">SLYV</span><span class="direction">(almost intoxicated)</span> It sounded so pretty. It was drifty and so, so... --? Rag</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">NEUE</span>Ragathinning?</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">SLYV</span>Yes! <span class="direction">(she focuses)</span> What is it?</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">Neue's taken aback by Slyv's straightforward request. Slyv, recognizing this, introduces herself.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">SLYV</span>I'm SLYV.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">NEUE</span>NEUE.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">They stand silently for a moment as a group of older and cleaner people walk past them. One of the group's members speaks aloud.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">PASSER BY</span>They just treat themselves like nothing, they have no shame. How are you supposed to survive in a world like this...</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">As the group passes them, Neue pulls Slyv closer to whisper in her ear.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">NEUE</span><span class="direction">(softly)</span> You really don't know? What ragathinning is?</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">Slyv shakes her head no. She's confused.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">NEUE</span>Where have you been?</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">Slyv looks around at her surroundings; the people lining up and going back and repeating the light cycle. Everyone looks — all of a sudden — beat up, tired, and dirty. A different group of older people stand together talking amongst themselves (again, cleaner than the rest.)</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">STANDER-BY</span>There's something so lucrative about this business, it's hard to describe what it is...</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">NEUE</span><span class="direction">(to Slyv)</span> It's hard to get out of this place once you're in it for so long.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">Slyv stares at people on the floor. Their faces, clothes, and bodies are worn in. Neue leans into Slyv.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">NEUE</span><span class="direction">(whispering)</span> You see how everyone here is just what you think them to be?</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">Slyv remains staring at them and nods, slowly. Everyone is itching to get back in the light.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">NEUE</span><span class="direction">(whispering)</span> Imagine if you could have them for yourself. And you can do with them whatever you want.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">Slyv, still stares off to the distance.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">SLYV</span>If I had them all for me?</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">NEUE</span>Then you'd be able to do with them whatever you wanted.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">SLYV</span>But they're people.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">Slyv turns toward Neue.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">SLYV</span>They're living and they're real.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">NEUE</span>They may be real people, but do you call this living?</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">WE SEE the human face of the young woman grow, slowly, back to being inhuman as she searches again for the digitized glass.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">SLYV</span><span class="direction">(O.S.)</span> What could be better than this for them?</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">NEUE</span><span class="direction">(O.S.)</span> That's for someone like you to decide,</div>
  </div>

  <!-- DIALOGUE 2 -->
  <div id="dialogue-2">
    <div class="dialogue-title">prophet</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">IVY</span>I heard that it feels like almost ascending sort of, when you are stolen.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">RAY</span>How?</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">IVY</span>They were playing a public service announcement as I walked through the bus station.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">RAY</span><span class="direction">(as in, 'go on')</span> Mmhm...</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">IVY</span>the drug they use to make you small is like a distortion</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">RAY</span>like the brain or the body?</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">Ivy nods. Ray squints and scrunches his forehead, confused, he looks away as Ivy continues.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">IVY</span>You don't know what you're looking at or what you're feeling. but you are aware that you were chosen.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">RAY</span><span class="direction">(getting it)</span> Because you were.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">IVY</span>like everyone else who is alive is actually dead, and you've made it through the apocalypse into something else.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">Ray looks at the statue of the religious figure in the shop.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">IVY</span><span class="direction">(O.S.)</span> Or so said the government-issued campaign.</div>
  </div>

  <!-- DIALOGUE 3 -->
  <div id="dialogue-3">
    <div class="dialogue-title">paradise</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">P and Bea are lying backwards on top of bean bag cushions on the ground looking up at the sky in silence.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">P and Bea are kicking their feet and fidgeting as they look up at the sky.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">P</span>What time you say is it?</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">BEA</span>ummm depending</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">Bea points up at the sky.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">BEA</span>Is that sun or the moon</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">P</span>Not clear</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">BEA</span>blurry</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">P squints and shrugs and sighs out of uncertainty.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">P</span>So either he is late or he will be early</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">P and Bea kick around a bit more.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">BEA</span>Late, he's definitely late otherwise we wouldn't be waiting here and we would have been here later</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">P</span>Unless we were early</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">P and Bea kick around a bit more.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">BEA</span>How are we supposed to explain it</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">P</span>Explain what</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">BEA</span>The different steps</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">Bea holds up 2 fingers and squints at them, looking at the light shining between the two fingers from the sky.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">BEA</span>Because we can tell him the sexual way or the uh</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">Bea thinks. P fills the silence.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">P</span>Thaaa</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">BEA</span><span class="direction">(forgot the right word)</span> Insexual, nonsexual way</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">P</span>There's nothing sexual even about it</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">BEA</span>That's why it is the insexual way</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">P</span>No I mean the sexual way</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">BEA</span><span class="direction">(nodding head)</span> Ohhh</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">Bea doesn't respond. Still kicking feet.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">BEA</span>Well in the sexual way you have to kiss the person and that feels at least a little sexual</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">Bea holds up a little with their fingers, squinting again at it.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">P</span>Yeah but that's as far as it goes</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">BEA</span>Maybe it is easier to explain the ab-sexual way because then it is one less step because you don't have to use the paste to protect your mouth</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">P</span>But usually people like the other way</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">BEA</span>Yeah because it's sexual</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">P sees what Bea means now.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">P</span>I think what I'm getting at is-</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">Interrupted by a voice.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">JUDE</span>Hi,</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">Bea and P roll off their bean bags and onto the floor.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">BEA</span>You're right on time</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">Bea squints and puts out one hand for each question.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">P</span>Would you rather kiss them before you shrink them or would you rather find another way like a no-contact</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">BEA</span>Because if you kiss them that's sexual</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">P</span><span class="direction">(to Jude)</span> I don't think so</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">BEA</span><span class="direction">(to Jude)</span> I do, do you?</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">Jude shrugs and sits.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">JUDE</span>I'll just do whatever the two of you tell me to.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">Bea takes out three bags and places them on the ground. Bea points at each as P explains.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">BEA</span>So there are three steps...</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">P</span>You coat your mouth. all inside</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">BEA</span>You can't miss even a dot</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">P</span>Then, spread this in your mouth and your lips. From there you have five minutes to kiss, rinse and spit.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">Bea holds up 5 on her hand.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">BEA</span>5 minutes. 5 minutes</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">P points at the last bag.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">P</span>Put this on their tongue and pick them up once they shrink.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">Bea holds up one finger.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">BEA</span>Most important thing... light. Be prepared with your container or your bag. You have to put them in light right away</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">JUDE</span>Otherwise what</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">P fake falls back dead. Bea falls backward as well. Both with their tongues out like they are dead. Jude waits for something to happen but nothing does.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">Jude puts the money on the floor and takes the bags. He scurries off.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">Still in the same 'dead' position with her tongue out, P opens one of her eyes and looks at Bea.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">P</span>Psst</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">Bea, also in the same position with her tongue out, opens one of her eyes.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">BEA</span>Pssst</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">We go back and forth, their tongues stay in their mouths in between so they can talk.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">P</span>Do you know who came by yesterday</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">BEA</span>No</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">P</span>Ash</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">BEA</span>Aw I missed</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">P</span>I know</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">BEA</span>His hair is awesome</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">P</span>I know</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">One moment, both Bea and P have their one eye open but their tongues are in their mouths. Their eyes are surveying around the sky.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">BEA</span>I still can't tell the time</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">P brings her eye back to Bea.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">P</span>Do you know what he told me?</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">Bea brings her eye back to P.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">BEA</span>No</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">P</span>He said that it feels like dying apparently, after the third step</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">BEA</span>How would Ash know?</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">P</span>He said that his guy told him</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">BEA</span>Who is his guy</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">P</span>I don't know</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">BEA</span>Well what does dying feel like</div>
    <div class="dialogue-line"><span class="speaker">P</span>Like you're in paradise.</div>
    <div class="dialogue-action">Bea and P stay for a moment. They close their eyes and stick their tongues back out.</div>
  </div>

